<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting us regarding the status of your transcript.</font></div><div><font face="arial">It generally takes two to three weeks to match a transcript to your application, though it could take longer at times of higher volume. If you requested your transcript be sent to ASU more than a month ago, please check with your registrar to make sure it was delivered. You may need to have it resent.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I appreciate your patience, and I encourage you to check <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> regularly. Your <b>Priority Tasks</b> list will be updated once the transcript has been received.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>